    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's helpful. some of those points feel a bit like the usual NIMBY complaints though—like people just being against change for the sake of it. do you think there are any actual, legitimate technical or economic arguments against high-density zoning, or is it mostly just people trying to protect their own property values?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
